## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
```bash
# Start the backend
cd backend && uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000

# Test 1: Full flow (Roman Urdu)
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/service-requests \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer <token>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"text": "Mujhe kal subah G-13 mein AC technician chahiye"}'

# Test 2: Full flow (English)  
curl -X POST ... -d '{"text": "I need a plumber in F-10 tomorrow at 9am"}'

# Test 3: Clarification flow
curl -X POST ... -d '{"text": "AC chahiye"}'
# Resume with details
curl -X POST ... -d '{"text": "G-13 mein, kal subah", "conversation_id": "<id>"}'

# Test 4: No providers found (edge case)
curl -X POST ... -d '{"text": "I need a tutor in Z-99 right now"}'
```

### Quality Checks
- [ ] Response is ≤ 2 sentences (not a paragraph)
- [ ] Roman Urdu sounds like natural texting
- [ ] No "I've found" / "Based on your request" / "I'd be happy to" in output
- [ ] Booking card renders correctly
- [ ] Trace timeline shows ReAct reasoning steps
- [ ] Clarifier asks for ALL missing slots in one message
- [ ] Follow-up suggestions appear after booking
